{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"785","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"擺脫塑膠大國稱號 泰國推各式減塑政策","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">最新更新：<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2020/01/28 18:26</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.stspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/%E6%B3%B0%E5%9C%8B%E5%A1%91%E8%86%A0.jpg\\\" style=\\\"border: 0px; border-image: none; width: 80%; vertical-align: middle; box-sizing: border-box;\\\" /></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">泰國要擺脫塑膠大國的稱號，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">75</span>家零售業者從元旦起不再提供顧客一次性塑膠袋，希望每年減少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">30%</span>、也就是<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">135</span>億個塑膠袋使用量。中央社記者呂欣憓曼谷攝<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span>&nbsp;</span>109</span>年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1</span>月<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">28</span>日</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\" />\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">（中央社記者呂欣憓曼谷<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">28</span>日專電）泰國努力擺脫塑膠大國的名號，近幾年推出許多活動和政策提高泰國人環保意識，最新措施是商店和超市不提供一次性塑膠袋，已於今年元旦上路，成效如何仍有待觀察。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">東南亞國家製造的塑膠垃圾量在全球名列前茅，根據泰國匯商銀行經濟與商業研究中心研究，泰國是全世界第<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">6</span>大海洋塑膠垃圾製造國，僅次於中國、印尼、菲律賓、越南和斯里蘭卡。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">泰國是大量使用塑膠製品的國家，根據聯合國資料，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2016</span>年在泰國沿海省分收集到<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1078</span>萬噸的垃圾，其中<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">130</span>萬噸是塑膠垃圾。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">以曼谷市為例，曼谷市政府每天收到的垃圾有多達<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">8000</span>萬個塑膠袋，市民約為<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1000</span>多萬人，平均每人每天使用多達<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">8</span>個塑膠袋。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">泰國想要展現減塑決心，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2018</span>年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">6</span>月在泰國舉行的東南亞國家協會高峰會就通過了「曼谷宣言」（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Bangkok Declaration on Combating Marine Debris in ASEAN Region</span>），指出各國認知到海洋垃圾多數來自陸地，誓言要與各國共同合作，減少海洋垃圾。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">根據泰國汙染控制局（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Pollution Control Department</span>）統計，泰國每年用掉<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">450</span>億個塑膠袋，其中<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>成約<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">180</span>億個塑膠袋來自傳統市場或是街頭小販，其中<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>成約<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">135</span>億個來自零售業者，還有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>成來自超市和百貨公司。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">泰國零售業協會（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Thai Retailers Association</span>）因此發起了減塑活動，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2018</span>年起每個月第<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>天為無塑膠袋日，當時有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">42</span>家企業加入，零售業協會並從<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2018</span>年的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">12</span>月<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>日到<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2019</span>年的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">8</span>月<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">31</span>日發起點數回饋活動，過去兩年因此減少了<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">20</span>億個塑膠袋使用量。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">為了減少更多塑膠袋使用量，零售業協會更決定發起每天向塑膠袋說不活動，加入協會的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">75</span>家企業共<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2</span>萬<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4500</span>個通路，從今年元旦起，全面停止提供免費塑膠袋，希望每年減少<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">30%</span>、也就是<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">135</span>億個塑膠袋使用量。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">泰國政府更打算從明年開始禁止商家使用塑膠杯和塑膠吸管。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">這並非泰國第一次推出大型減塑活動，泰國政府在<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2018</span>年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">8</span>月開始，在全國<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">154</span>座國家公園禁止塑膠袋、吸管、保麗龍和塑膠杯碗盤等一次性塑膠製品進入園區；<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2018</span>年不少連鎖的旅館業者宣布不提供一次性塑膠沐浴用品、吸管和瓶裝水。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">泰國國家海洋與沿海資源部（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Department of Marine and Coastal Resources</span>）還訂出<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2027</span>年減塑目標，希望屆時每個泰國人每天使用的塑膠袋減少至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2</span>個，同時訂定短、中、長期減塑計畫，希望將海中和海岸垃圾減少一半。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">但消費者習慣並非一夕可以改變，民族報（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">The Nation</span>）在去年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">9</span>月曾經實地走訪各大商店和超市，發現多數消費者仍然習慣買東西要塑膠袋，這次元旦起業者不提供塑膠袋，是否可以扭轉多數人的使用習性，仍待進一步觀察。（編輯：林憬屏<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1090128</span>）</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">資料來源<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">: https://www.cna.com.tw/news/aopl/202001280162.aspx</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2020-01-31","clk_count":"262"}},"__N_SSG":true}